{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/d164b9719aefa4f303eb7cbeacb4b385.avif?t=1753080365\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've suddenly become the balance director of a TCG company. To avoid being fired, you must boost sales through card releases and balance adjustments to meet your quota. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/18d86366a5e3b97634da3c3faf010876.avif?t=1753080365\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the card game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the TCG operator and decide which cards to be released or banned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/ebc70dbf7739af9716422662a716a7e6.avif?t=1753080365\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resell your cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy banned cards cheaply in advance, lift the bans, and sell them at high prices to make money. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/02e9a93fa4b8e13dba52f623090e2584.poster.avif?t=1753080365\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/02e9a93fa4b8e13dba52f623090e2584.webm?t=1753080365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/02e9a93fa4b8e13dba52f623090e2584.mp4?t=1753080365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get more cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your profits to open booster packs and collect more cards and enhancement effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/7e544ff4a2a40b4d5d09255ce6402f84.poster.avif?t=1753080365\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/7e544ff4a2a40b4d5d09255ce6402f84.webm?t=1753080365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/extras/7e544ff4a2a40b4d5d09255ce6402f84.mp4?t=1753080365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win card battles to change your deck's evaluation and silence player complaints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you revive the card game and satisfy both the strict chairman and the demanding players?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569850?t=1753080365","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569850?t=1753080365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569850/3a91226ae5cb269da7bb2580f23893036b5dff8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753080365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_